  "data": {
    "acts": [
      {
        "id": "act-01",
        "title": "雨夜·一百文",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.rainy-hut-night",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "apo", "assetId": "character.apo", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "awan", "assetId": "character.awan", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-01-text-01", "content": "雨下了七天，江水涨了，家里能变卖的东西也变卖得差不多了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-02", "content": "我把木匣里的铜钱全倒在桌上，数了三遍——整整一百文，刚够渡一次江。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-03", "content": "阿婆，钱够了，明早我就过江去抓药。", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-04", "content": "（咳嗽）傻孩子，雷家渡哪是一百文能打发的……到了那儿，还有的是名目。", "speakerId": "apo", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "阿婆"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-05", "content": "那也得去。郎中和七叶莲都在江南岸，您的病拖不得了。", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-06", "content": "阿婆不说话了，只顾咳嗽。爹走了七年，这个渡口，就是咱家翻不过去的山。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-07", "content": "爹说过，从咱镇上到南岸，本来一根绳就能过去。七年前他真去架了，桥架到一半，绳索夜里被人割断，人也坠进了江心。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-08", "content": "打那以后，江上就剩雷家一个渡口。渡主雷五，人称雷半江——半条江，都跟他自己家的似的。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：屋内｜夜｜雨。油灯、木匣。雨夜山村小屋，铜钱倒在桌上，压抑中埋火种。\n原始在场：我（阿绾，十七岁，索桥匠之女） · 阿婆（祖母，卧病）\n迁移备注：无。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-02",
        "title": "雷家渡·清晨",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.river-ferry-morning",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "oldman", "assetId": "character.old-villager", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "awan", "assetId": "character.awan", "position": "center"},
          {"instanceId": "leiwu", "assetId": "character.lei-wu", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-02-text-01", "content": "天刚亮，栅栏前已经排了二十来个人。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-02", "content": "（眼皮不抬）过江一百文，挑担的加五十，抬病人的两百。", "speakerId": "leiwu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "雷五"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-03", "content": "（把钱码在柜上）老板，一个人，过江抓药，一百文。", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-04", "content": "（抬眼打量我）你？一百五。", "speakerId": "leiwu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "雷五"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-05", "content": "你刚才不是说一百吗？", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-06", "content": "刚才是刚才。在这个渡口，价钱我说了算。嫌贵就回去。", "speakerId": "leiwu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "雷五"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-07", "content": "我还没接上话，身后一个老汉扑通跪下了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-08", "content": "（磕头）雷老爷行行好……我孙子烧了三天了，我就剩这六十文，先让我过江吧！", "speakerId": "oldman", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "老汉"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-09", "content": "老丈，我这儿不欠账。六十文，就渡你六十文的江。", "speakerId": "leiwu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "雷五"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-10", "content": "打手把老汉架到一边，一只草鞋掉在地上。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-11", "content": "（把兜里的钱塞给老汉）雷老板，差的四十我记账，卖了柴当天送回来。", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-12", "content": "（笑出声）记账？我雷家渡开了七年，没记过一笔账。你的渡钱，两百文。什么时候凑齐，什么时候来求我。", "speakerId": "leiwu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "雷五"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-13", "content": "人群外头，一个戴半张木面的灰袍人捡起草鞋，放回老汉手里，路过我身边时低声说了句——", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-14", "content": "姑娘，别跟他讲理，讲不通的。", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-15", "content": "我想追问，一转眼，人已经没影了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：渡口｜晨｜雨后初晴。木栅栏、收钱柜，排队渡客与打手作背景远景。\n原始在场：我 · 雷五（渡主，人称雷半江） · 老汉（求渡的镇民） · 神秘人（第一次现身） · 打手两名（环境人物） · 渡客数人（环境人物）\n迁移备注：受 characters maxItems=3 限制，神秘人末段现身保留为画外文本，打手与渡客作背景远景。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-03",
        "title": "爹的绳屋·夜",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.rope-workshop-night",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "yashu", "assetId": "character.ya-shu", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "awan", "assetId": "character.awan", "position": "center"},
          {"instanceId": "mystic", "assetId": "character.mystic-gray", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-03-text-01", "content": "镇尾的旧工棚，封条贴了七年，纸都烂透了。我推门进去，满屋落灰的绳索，抓起一把，还结实。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-02", "content": "（摸过桌上的索刀）爹的家什，一样没少。", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-03", "content": "墙角忽然响了一声。我抓起刀回头——筐子后头站起来个佝偻的影子，冲我直摆手。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-04", "content": "哑叔？这些年，你一直守在这儿？", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-05", "content": "哑叔是爹当年架桥的搭手，不会说话。爹出事后，他在下游捞了三天，只捞上来半卷图。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-06", "content": "他把图在桌上摊开，手指点在一处——老鸦口，江面最窄的地方，爹当年就想把桥架在那儿。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-07", "content": "他比划了半天：指江，指渡口，最后做了个拿刀割绳的动作。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-08", "content": "我明白了。当年割绳的是雷五，今天，他割的还是绳子。", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-09", "content": "哑叔点头，又攥住我的手腕直摇头——他是说，危险。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-10", "content": "（把图揣进怀里）我知道危险。可阿婆的药等不了，这个渡口我也受够了。", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-11", "content": "出门时，那个灰袍人不知什么时候立在门口，像已经等了很久。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-12", "content": "姑娘，东西都在，就差一个敢用它的人了。", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-13", "content": "我回头再看，门外只有月亮。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：旧工棚｜夜｜月。绳索、索刀、半卷图样，月光从门口斜入。\n原始在场：我 · 哑叔（爹当年的架桥搭手，不能说话） · 神秘人（第二次现身，门外）\n迁移备注：哑叔无台词，以动作与旁白转述呈现。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-04",
        "title": "老鸦口·夜架",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.cliff-ravine-night",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "yashu", "assetId": "character.ya-shu", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "awan", "assetId": "character.awan", "position": "center"},
          {"instanceId": "mystic", "assetId": "character.mystic-gray", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-04-text-01", "content": "老鸦口是江面最窄的地方，水急得打漩，连船都不敢来。爹七年前钉下的铁桩还在崖壁上，锈了，但没松。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-02", "content": "（把风绳递给我，指指铁桩，又指指月亮）", "speakerId": "yashu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "action", "speakerName": "哑叔"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-03", "content": "我懂他的意思：桩还能用，得赶在天亮前。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-04", "content": "哑叔，你看好绳子。第一趟，我自己走。", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-05", "content": "我把腰带在铁桩上绕了三圈，打上爹教的回人结——人要是掉下去，绳子会咬住桩，把人吊住。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-06", "content": "崖风呜呜地吹，脚底下的江水黑得发亮。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-07", "content": "（贴着绳，一寸一寸往前挪）爹，你走过的路，我今天也走一遍。", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-08", "content": "脚踩上对岸那一瞬间，我腿一软，坐在地上笑了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-09", "content": "崖缝里就长着七叶莲。我采了药揣进怀里，一回头——石缝边站着那个灰袍人。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-10", "content": "头一个摸黑踏绳的，胆子不小。", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-11", "content": "我冲北岸的哑叔高高举起药。想再问那人是谁，他已经不在了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-12", "content": "我不知道的是，崖顶有个黑影把这一切看了个正着，正悄悄退进林子去报信。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：崖边｜夜｜月。旧铁桩、风绳，江峡湍流与浓雾。\n原始在场：我 · 哑叔（北岸望风） · 神秘人（第三次现身，南岸） · 可疑黑影（远处，无台词）\n迁移备注：可疑黑影作为文本伏笔保留，画面不作摆位。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-05",
        "title": "断索·清晨",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.cliff-ravine-morning",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "mystic", "assetId": "character.mystic-gray", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "awan", "assetId": "character.awan", "position": "center"},
          {"instanceId": "leiwu", "assetId": "character.lei-wu", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-05-text-01", "content": "回程走到江心，药贴在心口，脚底下是百丈深的江。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-02", "content": "就在这时，北岸锚桩前火光一亮——雷五带着四五个人，等在了我绳子那头。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-03", "content": "（摸着锚桩）姑娘，一晚上架起一座桥，好手艺。可惜啊，这江是雷家的江。", "speakerId": "leiwu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "雷五"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-04", "content": "他朝身后一抬下巴，有人抽出刀，架在了主索上。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-05", "content": "雷五！阿婆等着药救命，你让开！", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-06", "content": "急什么。二十年前这桥塌过一回，收了十一条人命，里头有我亲兄弟。打那天起我就想明白了——人靠不住，绳靠不住，只有钱靠得住。", "speakerId": "leiwu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "雷五"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-07", "content": "你算的是你那口收钱的柜子吧！", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-08", "content": "（脸一沉，抬手）割。", "speakerId": "leiwu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "雷五"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-09", "content": "刀落下去，主索应声而断。我整个人荡了下去，全靠腰间的保命绳吊在半空。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-10", "content": "（踱到崖边）两条路。跪下，叫我一声老爷，我拉你上来，往后安分买渡。不跪——绳子放到头，药喂鱼。", "speakerId": "leiwu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "雷五"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-11", "content": "我在风里荡着。低头，是七年前吞了爹的那条江；抬头，对岸的天正一点点亮起来。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-12", "content": "（忽然就不晃了）雷五，我爹当年就没跪过你，我也不跪。", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-13", "content": "你不是怕桥塌死人——你是怕大家伙儿过了江，就再也不用来求你了吧？", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-14", "content": "他刀刚抬起，崖顶传来铜锣声——是哑叔！他敲着爹留下的旧锣，身后跟着镇上的人，先是两个，然后十个，最后整片崖顶都站满了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-15", "content": "人群最前头，那个戴半张木面的灰袍人第一个蹲下去，攥住了断掉的绳头。老汉蹲第二个，第三个攥住第二个的手腕……绳头一路排下去。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-16", "content": "（扯着嗓子喊）雷五！一根绳你割得断，一千只手，你割哪一只？", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-17", "content": "打手们看看刀，又看看人群——里头站着他们自家的爹娘兄弟。刀，慢慢放下了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-18", "content": "十几双手一齐把断绳拽回锚桩，哑叔抢上去打结，绳子重新绷直，把我稳稳托住了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：崖边｜晨｜晴。主索、锚桩、火把，全镇人闻锣而来。\n原始在场：我（江心半空） · 雷五 · 打手四五名 · 哑叔（崖顶敲锣） · 神秘人（第四次现身，人群最前，一言不发） · 镇民（环境人物，越聚越多）\n迁移备注：受 characters maxItems=3 限制，哑叔与镇民以旁白呈现，打手作背景远景；神秘人本幕无言，保留人群最前位置。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-06",
        "title": "新桥·三日",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.new-bridge-day",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "apo", "assetId": "character.apo", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "awan", "assetId": "character.awan", "position": "center"},
          {"instanceId": "leiwu", "assetId": "character.lei-wu", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-06-text-01", "content": "当天晌午，七叶莲煎进了药罐。阿婆喝完药，睡了两年来头一个囫囵觉。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-02", "content": "（第二天早上，看着我）绾儿，你这双手，比你爹的还稳。", "speakerId": "apo", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "阿婆"}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-03", "content": "一放晴，镇上的人自己扛着绳索上了老鸦口，会打结的打结，不会打结的递绳。第三天太阳落山，最后一根主索绷紧——桥，通了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-04", "content": "没人给桥起名字，镇上人只叫它新桥。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-05", "content": "下游的雷家渡，七年来头一回，一整天没等到一个客人。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-06", "content": "傍晚，我提着一吊钱走到渡口，轻轻放在柜上。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-07", "content": "雷老板，当年差的四十文，今天连本带利还清。往后，咱们两清了。", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-08", "content": "雷五没答话。夜里，他一个人踩上新桥，走到江心，站了很久——二十年前，他兄弟就是从桥下这片江水里没能上来。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-09", "content": "后来，他把钱柜上那把铜锁摘下来，扔进了江里。再后来，有人说他出了上游的隘口，也有人说，根本没看见过。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：屋内／崖边／渡口｜三日间｜晴，三段小景按原文并入一幕。\n原始在场：我 · 阿婆（痊愈中） · 哑叔（镇民架桥） · 雷五（夜上新桥、弃锁） · 镇民众人（环境人物）\n迁移备注：哑叔以旁白呈现；雷五仅傍晚还钱一段在场，夜行弃锁为旁白转述。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-07",
        "title": "桥头·神秘人",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.bridge-fog-morning",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "awan", "assetId": "character.awan", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "mystic", "assetId": "character.mystic-gray", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-07-text-01", "content": "后来的事，镇上人说起来都很平常。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-02", "content": "说新桥上走过货郎、郎中、抬花轿的，也走过老汉家那个退了烧的孩子。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-03", "content": "桥头多了根拴绳的木桩，谁家娃想学打结就自己打，打错了，哑叔会替你拆掉重来。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-04", "content": "（跑过，声音渐远）娘，这个结叫什么呀？", "speakerId": "kid", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "孩童"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-05", "content": "（声音也远了）叫回人结。人掉下去，它会把你拉回来。", "speakerId": "awan", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-06", "content": "雾从桥两头漫上来。桥头立着那个灰袍人，半张木面朝着晨光，像已经等了很久。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-07", "content": "姑娘——不，该改口了。求愿的人，梦到这儿，该醒了。", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-08", "content": "你进来的时候，心里憋着的那件事，我都听见了。可你真正想要的，是把\"我的路由我走\"这句话，重新拿回自己手里，对不对？", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-09", "content": "这座桥是怎么架起来的，你比谁都清楚——不靠一声怒吼，靠一寸一寸、打得不错的结。你往后的路，也是一样。", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-10", "content": "往后像雷家渡那样的柜子，哪儿都会有。你记住今天就行——自己的路，自己能走。", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-11", "content": "去吧。先锋不在别处——头一个把脚踏上绳的人，就是先锋。", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-12", "content": "他转身走进雾里。江声退去。我摊开手心，好像还留着一截绳子的糙。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：桥上｜晨｜雾。绳身、桥头的木桩，雾中桥头。\n原始在场：我 · 过桥孩童（声，环境人物） · 神秘人（第五次现身，桥头，向求愿者直接开口）\n迁移备注：孩童为画外声，不作摆位。原剧本 act-07-text-08 中的动态占位符（所求何事／深层情绪）已按交付决定改写为固定句。"
      }
    ]
  }
}
